1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,971
First, create a new folder in your “Project Management” panel

2
00:00:04,971 --> 00:00:15,048
Next, move your project into the new folder

3
00:00:15,048 --> 00:00:29,262
In the new folder, you can set up new “Item Category”

4
00:00:29,262 --> 00:00:35,602
Go to “CTA Canvas” and enable “Add To Cart Block”

5
00:00:35,602 --> 00:00:42,075
Create “Hotspot Area” and select “Add An Item” function

6
00:00:42,075 --> 00:00:49,182
Fill in your item details on the right panel

7
00:00:49,182 --> 00:00:55,622
Next, create “Add To Cart” hotspot area

8
00:00:55,622 --> 00:01:05,365
You can sellect the link item based on your set up earlier

9
00:01:05,365 --> 00:01:16,776
Lastly, add in the “View Cart” hotspot area
